{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，你知道日本有个词叫『言灵』吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"言灵……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"据说言语中寄宿着某种灵力，并会对现实产生影响……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"喂喂，你没事吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"是不是我说得太玄乎了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不过，你有没有过因为同伴的鼓励，发挥出意想不到力量的时候？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"反过来，也可能因为一句伤人的话，连一半实力都发挥不出来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这个我懂。言语对人的精神状态影响很大。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"CO-OPS通信也是一样。对同伴说些鼓励的话，也许就能让他跑得比平时更快。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"本来已经濒死、动弹不得的人，说不定也能重新站起来……对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"原来如此。反过来也一样，是吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"言语拥有各种各样的力量。你多试试看吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"}]}